<li><b>Status:</b> fixed in version 1.0.1008.0 </li></ul>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Attempting to run the ERF and GFF Editors as stand alone applications from the Dragon Age\tools\ directory (as opposed to within the toolset) will result in a "Keyfile not found" error.  This is a remnant of the security that was in place for our Beta Testers.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Workarounds">Workarounds</span></h2>
<p>GFF and ERF files can be opened by the main toolset, which acts as a wrapper around the GFF and ERF editors that bypasses the key checks. The key checks only remained in place for the standalone editors.
</p>
